	(text_box "Connect a USB-C cable from a host PC to the USB-C receptacle. The debug UART will enumerate on the host system as a virtual COM port.\n\nWhen the boot selection switch is set to the \"UART and USB\" position, this virtual COM port can be used to program the MPU.\n\nThe virtual COM port may also be used as an external serial interface for communication with the MPU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
